但是你知道的，要付出代價的 現在我成了大公司的傀儡

291
00:20:43,100 --> 00:20:45,400
and punching a clock..
每天打卡上班

292
00:20:45,570 --> 00:20:47,440
and paying taxes!
然後還要繳稅！

293
00:20:48,340 --> 00:20:51,240
Phoebe, honey, if you hate it so much..
菲比，親愛的，如果 你這樣痛恨這工作…

294
00:20:51,410 --> 00:20:55,140
you should walk out there right now and quit.
你應該馬上走出去然後辭職

295
00:20:55,450 --> 00:20:57,940
Be true to what you believe in.
相信你所堅信的理念

296
00:20:58,120 --> 00:21:01,750
Honey, you have principles, and I so admire that.
親愛的，你是有原則的人 所以我很欽佩你的

297
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:04,120
I don't have any.
我才是沒有原則

298
00:21:05,890 --> 00:21:08,880
You know what? You're right. I am gonna quit.
你知道嗎？你說的對，我要去辭職

299
00:21:09,060 --> 00:21:12,790
- It's time I took my life back. - Good for you, Phoebe.
-該是我重新生活的時候了 -很好，菲比

300
00:21:16,070 --> 00:21:20,900
If you guys have microphones in there too, I didn't mean any of that.
如果你們在裡面也有裝麥克風 我在裡面說的都不是真的

301
00:21:21,580 --> 00:21:23,440
I love you.
我愛你們

302
00:21:26,150 --> 00:21:30,580
Got you! Die! Die! Die!
打到了！死吧！死吧！死吧！

303
00:21:31,690 --> 00:21:35,990
Respectfully, Professor R. Geller.
誠摯地，蓋勒教授敬上

304
00:21:37,090 --> 00:21:38,420
- Hey. - Hi.
-嘿 -嗨

305
00:21:38,590 --> 00:21:40,490
Hey, how was the Met?
嘿，大都會好玩嗎？

306
00:21:40,660 --> 00:21:42,750
The museum was amazing.
博物館真的很驚人

307
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:45,300
Yeah, Joey really knows his art, huh?
是啊，喬伊真的很懂藝術不是嗎？

308
00:21:45,470 --> 00:21:47,630
Not so much, no.
並不盡然，不

309
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:50,500
He had clearly memorized all this stuff to say..
很明顯地他清楚地背下了要說的東西…

310
00:21:50,670 --> 00:21:53,440
and some of it didn't even make any sense.
但是很多東西都很不對勁

311
00:21:54,210 --> 00:21:55,970
- What do you mean? - Well, for one..
-你是什麼意思呢？ -嗯，例如…

312
00:21:56,140 --> 00:21:59,110
he was talking about paintings that were nowhere around.
他談論的都是根本不在展出的繪畫

313
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:06,440
Wait a minute. When you guys walked into the Met, did you go to the right?
等等，你們進入博物館之後 是往右邊走嗎？

314
00:22:06,620 --> 00:22:10,560
- No. No, we went to the left. - Oh, Joey, Joey, Joey.
-不不，我們往左邊走 -喔，喬伊，喬伊，喬伊

315
00:22:12,930 --> 00:22:16,490
Still, it seems like you guys are having a great time together.
可是你們看起來也是度過快樂的時光啊

316
00:22:17,230 --> 00:22:19,990
Yeah. Yeah, it's fun.
是啊，是很好玩

317
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,290
What?
怎樣？

318
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:26,970
Actually, Joey's your friend..
事實上，喬伊是你的朋友…

319
00:22:27,140 --> 00:22:29,730
and you don't know me that well. It'd be weird.
而你也不是很瞭解我 這會很奇怪的

320
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:32,810
Well, I mean, a little. But no, what? Go on.
嗯，可能會有點，但是不會啦 怎樣呢？跟我說

321
00:22:32,980 --> 00:22:34,000
Well..
嗯…

322
00:22:35,150 --> 00:22:38,740
I'm thinking that maybe Joey isn't the right guy for me right now.
我在想或許喬伊不是很適合我

323
00:22:38,950 --> 00:22:42,150
You know, maybe I should be with someone..
你知道的，或許我應該跟…

324
00:22:44,190 --> 00:22:47,960
I have more in common with. You know what I mean?
跟我比較相像的人在一起 你知道我的意思嗎？

325
00:22:49,260 --> 00:22:50,850
Yeah.
是啊

326
00:22:53,370 --> 00:22:55,860
Yeah, but you know what?
是啊，但是你知道嗎？

327
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:00,030
I think you should give Joey a chance.
我想你應該給喬伊一個機會

328
00:23:00,210 --> 00:23:02,040
I mean, he's a great guy.
我是說他是個好男人

329
00:23:02,210 --> 00:23:04,770
And sure, he doesn't know that much about art..
當然他是不知道很多藝術的東西

330
00:23:04,980 --> 00:23:07,670
but you can always talk about that with someone else.
但是你可以跟其他知道的人談論啊

331
00:23:07,850 --> 00:23:10,080
- I guess that's true. - If you think about it..
-我想也是 -如果你仔細想想…

332
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:14,410
he memorized all that stuff because he thought it was important to you.
他背下所有的東西只是因為 他認為那些東西對你很重要

333
00:23:14,590 --> 00:23:17,280
You know, that's the kind of guy Joey is.
你知道的，喬伊就是那樣子的人

334
00:23:17,490 --> 00:23:20,020
He is very sweet.
他是非常貼心的

335
00:23:20,190 --> 00:23:21,850
Plus, he is hot!
還有，他真是帥斃了！

336
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:26,690
That was gonna be my next argument.
這就是我下一個要爭論的

337
00:23:29,040 --> 00:23:31,090
- You ready? - Yeah. Let's go.
-你準備好了嗎？ -好了，我們走吧

338
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:32,300
Wow!
哇！

339
00:23:34,070 --> 00:23:36,240
- Thanks, Ross. - Yeah.
-謝了，羅斯 -不客氣

340
00:23:37,410 --> 00:23:41,040
Hey, Ross. That art stuff worked. You hooked me up.
嘿，羅斯，藝術那些東西真是有效 你真幫了大忙

341
00:23:42,820 --> 00:23:44,110
Glad I could help, man.
很高興能夠幫上忙，兄弟

342
00:23:44,320 --> 00:23:48,380
Some of the stuff wasn't where you said it would be, but I made it work.
有些你說的東西並沒有在那裡 但是我都搞定了

343
00:23:58,670 --> 00:24:02,900
It is not okay that I'm aroused by this now.
我現在不能因為這個而勃起了

344
00:24:06,540 --> 00:24:07,560
Hello?
哈囉？

345
00:24:08,070 --> 00:24:11,040
Oh. Hi, Dr. Connelly.
喔，嗨，唐納利醫生

346
00:24:11,410 --> 00:24:13,780
No. Well, she's not here..
不，她現在不在…

347
00:24:13,950 --> 00:24:15,470
but I can tell her.
但是我可以轉告她

348
00:24:15,650 --> 00:24:18,410
Should I be sitting down for this?
我應該先坐下來再聽嗎？

349
00:24:33,700 --> 00:24:36,290
Well, so, what does that mean?
那，那是什麼意思呢？

350
00:24:41,170 --> 00:24:43,540
Okay. Okay, thank you.
好的，好的，謝謝你

351
00:24:43,710 --> 00:24:45,340
Thanks.
謝謝

352
00:24:51,650 --> 00:24:53,120
Hey, sweetie.
嘿，親愛的

353
00:24:54,020 --> 00:24:55,510
Dr. Connelly just called.
唐納利醫生剛剛打電話來

354
00:24:55,690 --> 00:24:58,020
With good news? Of course it's not good news.
有好消息嗎？當然不是好消息囉

355
00:24:58,190 --> 00:25:00,020
You said, "Dr. Connelly just called."
你是說「唐納利醫生剛剛打電話來」

356
00:25:00,190 --> 00:25:03,220
If it was good, you'd have said, "Dr. Connelly just called!"
如果是好消息你會說 「唐納利醫生剛剛打電話來！」

357
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:05,560
So, what is it? Is it..?
那，是怎樣呢？是不是…

358
00:25:05,730 --> 00:25:09,790
Is there a problem? Is there a problem with me, or with you?
有問題嗎？是我的問題還是你的呢？

359
00:25:11,540 --> 00:25:13,730
Actually, it's both of us.
事實上我們兩個都有問題

360
00:25:15,140 --> 00:25:16,670
What?
什麼？

361
00:25:16,840 --> 00:25:20,010
Apparently, my sperm have low motility..
很顯然地，我的精子活動力太低了

362
00:25:20,180 --> 00:25:25,050
and you have an inhospitable environment.
而你有不適著床的環境

363
00:25:33,230 --> 00:25:35,320
Well, what does that mean?
喔，那是什麼意思呢？

364
00:25:35,530 --> 00:25:39,020
It means that my guys won't get off their Barcaloungers..
意思就是說我的人根本沒有辦法出兵…

365
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:42,900
and you have a uterus that is prepared to kill the ones that do.
而你的子宮已準備好 要殺死入侵的小兵了

366
00:25:45,710 --> 00:25:47,940
- It means.. - Wait, Chandler.
-意思是 -等等，錢德

367
00:25:52,210 --> 00:25:55,050
It means that we can keep trying..
意思是我們可以繼續嘗試…

368
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:59,380
but there's a good chance this may never happen for us.
但是我們很有可能永遠都不會懷孕

369
00:26:05,090 --> 00:26:07,060
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天

370
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,860
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉

371
00:26:11,430 --> 00:26:13,260
I'm sorry too.
我也很抱歉

372
00:26:16,940 --> 00:26:18,300
Well..
嗯…

373
00:26:18,870 --> 00:26:21,860
we're gonna figure this out.
我們會想出辦法的

374
00:26:24,910 --> 00:26:26,670
I know.
我知道

375
00:26:42,330 --> 00:26:46,130
- Good morning, Phoebe. - Good morning, receptionist.
-早安，菲比 -早安，總機小姐

376
00:26:46,300 --> 00:26:49,830
Here's your schedule for the day. Your first client is in Room 1.
這是你今天的工作排程 你第一位客人在一號房

377
00:26:50,570 --> 00:26:54,270
"Rachel Greene." Son of a bitch! She came back?
「瑞秋葛林」，狗娘養的！ 她又回來了？

378
00:27:02,450 --> 00:27:05,820
Are you ready for your Scottish massage?
你準備好要享受蘇格蘭式按摩了嗎？

379
00:27:06,150 --> 00:27:08,420
Put your face in the hole, lassie!
把臉放到洞中間 小妞！（蘇格蘭叫法）

380
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


381
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
